div class="max-w-[680px] mx-auto text-center mb-10"><h2 class="text-[clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.5rem)] font-black tracking-[-1px] text-[#e6edf5] mb-3">Make Any Photo Square in Seconds</h2><p class="text-[0.9rem] text-[#8d9aaa] leading-relaxed">Making an image square is essential for social media profiles, feed posts, and thumbnails. Unlike cropping, which cuts parts of your photo away, SquarePic makes an image square online by extending it with a blurred background, a solid color, or an automatic smart crop — so your full image stays visible. Use it as a free square image maker for Instagram, a photo resizer for any platform, or a quick way to keep an entire feed looking consistent.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10"><div class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.015)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] rounded-xl p-5 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-[var(--accent)]/10 text-[var(--accent)] text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold mb-3">1</span><h3 class="text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold text-[#e6edf5] mb-2">Upload Your Image</h3><p class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#8d9aaa] leading-relaxed m-0">Select any image from your device. SquarePic supports JPEG, PNG, WebP, and more. Files up to 20 MB.</p></div><div class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.015)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] rounded-xl p-5 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-[var(--accent)]/10 text-[var(--accent)] text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold mb-3">2</span><h3 class="text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold text-[#e6edf5] mb-2">Choose Your Style</h3><p class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#8d9aaa] leading-relaxed m-0">Pick Dynamic Blur for a soft gradient background, Solid Fill for a clean color match, or Smart Crop to fill the square automatically.</p></div><div class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.015)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] rounded-xl p-5 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-[var(--accent)]/10 text-[var(--accent)] text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold mb-3">3</span><h3 class="text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold text-[#e6edf5] mb-2">Download &amp; Share</h3><p class="text-[0.78rem] text-[#8d9aaa] leading-relaxed m-0">Export your square image as PNG, JPEG, or WebP. Ready to upload to Instagram, LinkedIn, Facebook, or any platform.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-10"><div class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.015)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] rounded-xl p-5"><h3 class="text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold text-[#e6edf5] mb-2">Three Ways to Make a Square Image</h3><ul class="text-[0.8rem] text-[#8d9aaa] leading-relaxed m-0 pl-4 space-y-1"><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">Dynamic Blur:</strong> Adds a blurred extension of your photo as the background. Creates a soft, professional look that Instagram influencers use for cohesive feeds.</li><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">Solid Fill:</strong> Adds a solid color background. Choose from preset colors or pick any custom color. Best for product photos and clean branding.</li><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">Smart Crop:</strong> Automatically crops the image to a square while keeping the most important content centered. No background extension needed.</li></ul></div><div class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.015)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] rounded-xl p-5"><h3 class="text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold text-[#e6edf5] mb-2">Best Uses for Square Images</h3><ul class="text-[0.8rem] text-[#8d9aaa] leading-relaxed m-0 pl-4 space-y-1"><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">Instagram feed &amp; posts:</strong> Square 1080x1080 posts display cleanly in the feed, grid, and profile — no surprise cropping on any device.</li><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">Profile pictures:</strong> Every social platform uses a square avatar. Make yours perfectly proportioned and centered.</li><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">LinkedIn &amp; Facebook posts:</strong> Square images render fully in feeds on desktop and mobile, keeping your brand consistent.</li><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">E-commerce product photos:</strong> Amazon and Shopify both recommend square product images for clean, uniform listings.</li><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">Website thumbnails &amp; favicons:</strong> Square thumbnails create tidy grid layouts, and favicons and app icons must be perfectly square.</li><li><strong class="text-[#e6edf5]">Quote graphics &amp; branded content:</strong> One square format keeps your entire feed or grid looking cohesive.</li></ul></div></div><div class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.015)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] rounded-xl p-6 mb-10"><h3 class="text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold text-[#e6edf5] mb-4">Social Media Square Size Quick Reference</h3><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-[0.78rem] border-collapse"><thead><tr class="border-b border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]"><th class="text-left font-bold text-[#e6edf5] py-2 pr-3">Platform</th><th class="text-left font-bold text-[#e6edf5] py-2 px-3">Profile Picture</th><th class="text-left font-bold text-[#e6edf5] py-2 px-3">Square Post (1:1)</th><th class="text-left font-bold text-[#e6edf5] py-2 pl-3">Best Format</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.03)]"><td class="font-semibold text-[#e6edf5] py-2.5 pr-3">Instagram</td><td class="text-[#8d9aaa] py-2.5 px-3">320x320</td><td class="text-[#8d9aaa] py-2.5 px-3">1080x1080</td><td class="text-[#8d9aaa] py-2.5 pl-3">JPEG / PNG</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.03)]"><td class="font-semibold text-[#e6edf5] py-2.5 pr-3">Facebook</td><td class="text-[#8d9aaa] py-2.5 px-3">320x320</td><td class="text-[#8d9aaa] py-2.5 px-3">1080x1080</td><td class="text-[#8d9aaa] py-2.5 pl-3">JPEG</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.03)]"><td class="font-semibold text-[#e6edf5] py-2.5 pr-3">LinkedIn</td><td class="text-[#8d9aaa] py-2.5 px-3">400x400</td><td class="text-[#8d9aaa] 